{"transcriptions": ["[0.86][S01] Yesterday it was 35 degrees in Barcelona, but today the temperature will go down to[7.81][7.81][S01] minus 20 degrees.[9.53]", "[0.76][S01] This week, I traveled to Chicago to deliver my final farewell address to the nation,[5.99][5.99][S01] following in the tradition of presidents before me.[8.94][8.94][S01] It was an opportunity to say thank you.[11.74][11.74][S01] Whether we've seen eye to eye, or rarely agreed at all, my conversations with you,[17.14][17.14][S01] the American people, in living rooms and schools, at farms and on factory floors,[23.32][23.32][S01] at diners, and on distant military outposts, all these conversations are what have kept[29.16][29.16][S01] me honest, kept me inspired, and kept me going.[33.15][33.15][S01] Every day, I learned from you.[35.82][35.82][S01] You made me a better president, and you made me a better man.[39.64][39.64][S01] Over the[39.97]"], "input_ids": [[151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643, 151643,